data Face = Face x0::Bool, x1::Bool
main =
  draw heard = Face (Uniform < 0.7) (Uniform < 0.2) in
  (isFace heard, heard)
-- Task tuple-ctor-test-of-shared-draw-wrong-result. Forward chaining merged
-- the two witnesses of `heard` by taking the first, the constructor test's
-- `Face ANY ANY`, so neither field was ever constrained: 1.0 at every point,
-- and `isFace` of the "anything but" sentinel crashed at a False first slot.
-- A whole value now wins over a constructor-test witness. isFace is always
-- True, so a True first slot leaves the fields' product.
